[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_ei6d5")
letter_id = 160
description = "My beloved bright mechanic,

I was just passing through a timeline so like your own when I heard a man speaking the language of the depths. Forgive me if my assumption is one of ignorance, but I did not believe such linguistics could evolve in a world such as that. I shall keep an eye and ear for more of these… [i]inconsistencies[/i] shall we say.

I do not know how you walk between times. For me, it is an innate pull, a connection to the powers that weave our worlds together. Power calls to powers so similar, but when met, there is either a beautiful harmony or a disastrous cacophony. I wonder about the fate of our intermingling powers and the timelines we weave between. Until we meet once more, please do keep an eye for anything suspicious.
[right]
-She who shall keep watch
"
letter_format = ExtResource("1_7ggjw")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://gbihjja6jybk"
